\n\nPosition 1 (ones): 4 + 2 = 6 ✔️.\n\nPosition 2 (tens): 3 + 0 = 3 ✔️.\n\nPosition 3 (hundreds): 9 +5=14 → 4 with carryover 1 ✔️.\n\nPosition 4 (thousands): 1 +4 +1 (carry) =6 ✔️.\n\nPosition 5 (ten thousands): 8 +5 =13 → 3, carryover 1 ✔️.\n\nPosition 6 (hundred thousands):7 +3 +1 (carry)= 11 → 1, carryover 1 ✔️.\n\nPosition 7 (millions):0 +9 +1 (carry)=10 → 0, carryover 1 ✔️.\n\nPosition 8 (ten millions):4 +5 +1 (carry)=10 →0, carryover1 ✔️.\n\nPosition 9 (hundred millions):0 +2 +1 (carry)=3 ✔️</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
