549 + 343,672,113:\n\nFirst, add 639,274,549 + 300,000,000 = 939,274,549\n\nThen add 43,672,113:\n\n939,274,549 + 40,000,000 = 979,274,549\n\nThen +3,672,113:\n\n979,274,549 +3,000,000 = 982,274,549\n\n+672,113 \u2192 982,274,549 + 600,000 = 982,874,549\n\n+72,113 \u2192 982,874,549 +72,000 = 982,946,549\n\n+113 \u2192 982,946,662.\n\nYes, that matches my previous result. So the correct answer is 982,946,662. The user's answer of 988,946,662 is off by 6 million. Probably a miscalculation in one of the digit places.\n\nTherefore, the final answer should be 982,946,662.\n</think>\n\n",
