osition6:1.\n\nPosition5:2.\n\nPosition4:3.\n\nPosition3:9.\n\nPosition2:5.\n\nPosition1:4.\n\nSo the final number is 1 (position10), followed by 2 (position9), 8 (position8), 2 (position7), 1 (position6), 2 (position5), 3 (position4), 9 (position3),5 (position2),4 (position1)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
